<title>GERMANY: German insolvencies up one pct yr/yr in Nov.</title>
<headline>German insolvencies up one pct yr/yr in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicators:</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN INSOLVENCIES	Nov  96	     Jan-Nov 96</p>
<p> Total insolvencies		2,501		  28,933</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		   +1.0		   +10.9</p>
<p> Company insolvencies	    2,024		  23,434</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		   +4.4		   +16.2</p>
<p>W.GERMAN INSOLVENCIES</p>
<p> Total insolvencies		1,846		  21,187</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		   -0.1		    +7.1</p>
<p> Company insolvencies	    1,445		  16,602</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		   +4.3		   +11.0</p>
<p>E.GERMAN INSOLVENCIES</p>
<p> Total insolvencies		  655		   7,746</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		   +4.0		   +22.8</p>
<p> Company insolvencies		579		   6,832</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		   +4.5		   +31.1</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
